Package: ssh-desk
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: hmplus28 <hmplus28@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: openssh-client
Recommends: gnome-keyring, libsecret-1-0
Suggests: seahorse
Description: SSH Desk - professional SSH connection manager for Ubuntu
 Desktop GUI + CLI for managing SSH servers: secure password storage in
 GNOME Keyring, real PTY terminal, SFTP file manager, port forwarding,
 jump hosts, saved commands and connection history.
Homepage: https://github.com/hmplus28/SSH-Desk
